    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The Logic Apps feature of Azure App Service is now available in the UK West and UK South Azure regions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information, please visit the <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/services/logic-apps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Logic Apps</a>&nbsp;page and the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/logic-apps/logic-apps-what-are-logic-apps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">What are logic apps?</a>&nbsp;documentation page.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The Logic Apps feature of Azure App Service is now available in the UK West and UK South Azure regions.\n\nFor more information, please visit the Logic Apps page and the What are logic apps? documentation page."
  },
